697
00:48:17,760 --> 00:48:20,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a northern dialect meaning cemetery.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

698
00:48:22,200 --> 00:48:24,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>"Heuw" as in a cemetery?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

699
00:48:25,440 --> 00:48:26,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A cemetery again?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

700
00:48:38,680 --> 00:48:41,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, they're all in there. Let's do it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

701
00:49:02,560 --> 00:49:04,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I happen</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

702
00:49:04,520 --> 00:49:07,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to know a good, honest police officer.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

703
00:49:07,280 --> 00:49:08,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

704
00:49:08,240 --> 00:49:11,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We must take you to Bangkok.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

705
00:49:11,080 --> 00:49:13,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>WANTED</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>CONTACT KAMNAN SAWAENG IF SEEN</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

706
00:49:13,840 --> 00:49:15,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

707
00:49:15,200 --> 00:49:16,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>NEXT EPISODE</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

708
00:49:20,000 --> 00:49:20,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Look over there.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

709
00:49:21,560 --> 00:49:22,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The border is just ahead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

710
00:49:23,000 --> 00:49:25,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, stop! It's a woman!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

711
00:49:25,160 --> 00:49:27,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey! Let me go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Don't move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

712
00:49:27,280 --> 00:49:29,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Oh my!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

713
00:49:29,400 --> 00:49:31,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That sounds like Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

714
00:49:31,120 --> 00:49:32,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You want this news, do you not?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

715
00:49:32,960 --> 00:49:35,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Weren't you the one</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who told me to stay out of this case?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

716
00:49:36,040 --> 00:49:38,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we cooperate, I will protect you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

717
00:49:38,440 --> 00:49:40,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You? Protect me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

718
00:49:42,760 --> 00:49:43,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

719
00:52:07,600 --> 00:52:12,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Subtitle translation by: Jarut K.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
